     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Registers 0x0c to 0x0e are a channel's sample position; the stream resumes from it and writes the played position back while register updates are enabled.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/k054539.cpp",
