    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "While the device's update-at-key-on flag and bit 0 of 0x22f are set, a write to 0x0c to 0x0e goes to a per-channel latch instead.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/k054539.cpp",
